  "scope": "Two exact pinned terminfo.dev@4.0.0 cases, extensions.sixel and extensions.iterm2-images. Both pinned callbacks (termless and terminal) are replayed from the retained pinned bundle and are always inconclusive. Two separately identified effect contracts compose the existing owned static-image carrier: blank-before, source-derived raster pixels at the controlled anchor with unchanged surroundings, and clear-after, over paired original offscreen PNGs, complete cell/mode reads and fresh raw fences. Protocol acknowledgement, reservation metadata and painted pixels are separate facts. A single-shot PNG at one 4x2 cell request and one fixed SIXEL packet only: no animation, Unicode placeholders, multipart or other image formats, font/DPI change, different-background compositing, remote/mux, other platforms, common-harness or stock-score claim. Kitty cases of the same carrier are not part of this qualification.",
